Package: astraea-service
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Lwb89dev <lwb89dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, dbus-user-session | dbus-x11
Recommends: gnome-keyring | kwalletmanager
Homepage: https://github.com/Lwb89dev/astraea
Description: Astraea calendar background service
 Session daemon for the Astraea Nostr calendar: local SQLite database,
 encrypted Nostr synchronization, browser-based authentication and the
 com.lwb89dev.Astraea D-Bus API used by the desktop app and the shell
 extensions. Started on demand via D-Bus activation; systemd is used when
 available but not required.
